stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observed
    Observed --> Clustered: normalize and fingerprint
    Clustered --> Candidate: fresh and campaign-relevant
    Clustered --> Expired: freshness exhausted
    Candidate --> EvidenceReady: fact snapshot available
    EvidenceReady --> Drafted: model authors master draft
    Drafted --> VariantReady: platform and account adaptation
    VariantReady --> Reviewing
    Reviewing --> VariantReady: rewrite required, attempts remain
    Reviewing --> Blocked: unfixable or rewrite budget exhausted
    Reviewing --> Queued: passed
    Queued --> Claimed: account lease acquired
    Claimed --> Submitted: external submit observed
    Claimed --> Queued: pre-submit retryable failure
    Submitted --> Reconciling: result uncertain
    Submitted --> AwaitingApproval: platform accepted request
    Reconciling --> AwaitingApproval: matching platform record found
    Reconciling --> Failed: definitive absence or mismatch
    AwaitingApproval --> Rejected: platform rejects content
    AwaitingApproval --> PublicReadback: platform approves
    Rejected --> Candidate: correctable replacement work
    PublicReadback --> Confirmed: public identity matches
    PublicReadback --> Failed: missing or mismatched public content
    Confirmed --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
